translate ptPT qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_4d440944:

    # "The man began to shake in my arms slightly, his body going into sharp spasms as he briefly wretched up some blood."
    "O homem começou a tremer ligeiramente em meus braços, seu corpo entrando em espasmos agudos enquanto expelia um pouco de sangue."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:132
translate ptPT qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_c10509ff:

    # "His wide young eyes soon began to turn cloudy, and the final gasp escaped his lips as his body went limp."
    "Seus olhos jovens e arregalados logo começaram a ficar turvos, e o último suspiro escapou de seus lábios enquanto seu corpo ficava mole."

